@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title One Driver session (epoch), as proposed

participant Host
participant Driver
Host -> Driver : gfdrv_negotiate(major 1, max_minor)
Host -> Driver : describe -> immutable metadata
note over Host : binding admission\n(compare metadata to Program contract)
Host -> Driver : open(binding_and_budget)
Driver --> Host : session (new epoch) or error, no output
loop each scan
  Host -> Driver : poll -> ordered input records
  note over Host : core evaluation and commit
  Host -> Driver : apply(safe commands) -> receipts
end
Host -> Driver : cancel(command_id) -> receipt (optional)
Host -> Driver : close (exactly once)
note over Host, Driver : restart = new session epoch,\nre-validate metadata and bindings,\nno implicit resume or replay
@enduml
